OL,3,GNEWSAInside one of Britain's most
OL,4,Amagnificent medieval relics
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt rises from the flat fields on the
OL,7,Fsouth bank of the Humber Estuary ` a
OL,8,Fmagnificent, towering building that, at
OL,9,Ffirst glance, resembles a castle.
OL,11,F"We are looking at, in a nutshell, the
OL,12,Flargest and most magnificent abbey
OL,13,Fgatehouse in the British Isles," says
OL,14,FDr Alastair Oswald, a historian with
OL,15,FEnglish Heritage.
OL,17,FHe is showing us around Thornton Abbey
OL,18,Fin North Lincolnshire, which was once
OL,19,Fone of the country's richest
OL,20,FAugustinian monasteries.
OL,23,APub: 12-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
